      "writtenOn": "2026-03-19T14:59:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "```suggestion\n                    if (dst_is_u16) {\n                        b.Return(f, b.Call\u003chlsl::ir::BuiltinCall\u003e(dst_type, BuiltinFn::kAsuint16,\n                                                                  f16_result));\n                    }\n                    b.Return(f, f16_result);\n```\n\nDon\u0027t need else as if returns",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 792,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 797,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "2d4dec11e3aa36732b071f4ea747cbc31c577b23",
