      },
      "lineNbr": 797,
      "author": {
        "id": 4024649
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-20T05:06:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "b.Return() is an IR builder call that appends a return instruction to the IR block — it does not return from the C++ function. Without the else, both b.Return() calls would execute when dst_is_u16 is true, emitting two IR ret instructions. The else is required here.",
